# Employee Management System (EMS)

A RESTful API for managing employee data—including their skills, projects, and employer details—using Spring Boot, MySQL, JPA, and Redis caching. This project demonstrates industry best practices such as proper layering (controllers, services, repositories), DTO-based API design, caching, validation, and error handling.

